{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_015kQjURzycikNG26A3Q8KNV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting. There are no existing tooltip or popover components in the codebase. There's no Popper.js dependency either. The story says to migrate tooltips and info-popovers, but there are none.\n\nWhat I see are:\n1. `title=` attributes used as native HTML tooltips (in Header, Gallery, etc.)\n2. Various show/hide components using `useState` (ChatWidget, CookieConsent, ExitIntentOverlay, etc.) - but these aren't really tooltips/popovers in the traditional sense\n\nThe story is asking to:\n1. Replace JavaScript show/hide logic with the HTML popover API\n\n\n2. Use CSS anchor positioning instead of JS positioning\n\nSince there's no actual tooltip library or Popper.js dependency, I need to create a tooltip/popover component using the native Popover API and convert some existing `title=` attributes to use proper popover-based tooltips. Looking at the acceptance criteria, it wants all tooltip and informational popover components to use the popover HTML attribute, but the bundle size reduction criterion doesn't really apply here since there's no Popper.js dependency to remove in the first place.\n\nLet me check if there are any components that act as tooltips or popovers using JS show/hide logic—the best candidates would be elements with `title=` attributes or components with toggle behavior. The minimal approach would be to create a small Tooltip component using the HTML Popover API with CSS anchor positioning, then convert a few `title=` attributes in the Header component to use this new component. But if there's nothing to remove, the bundle size criterion can't be met, so I should check the package.json to see if there's actually a dependency I'm missing.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2941,"cache_read_input_tokens":37850,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2941},"output_tokens":16,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"db47caa7-f1dd-496e-b0bd-79b00484628d","uuid":"54067374-ab92-408d-8b12-385ed49c3b55"}
